    content(p){return `<section class="container simple-page" aria-labelledby="received-title"><span class="eyebrow">Thank you for reaching out</span><h1 id="received-title">Your enquiry<br><em>has been submitted.</em></h1><div class="prose"><p>The form delivery service has received your enquiry for Diane. Once Diane has confirmed her recipient email address with the service, submissions can be delivered to her inbox.</p><p>For anything time-sensitive, you can email Diane directly at <a href="mailto:${esc(email)}">${esc(email)}</a>.</p>${link(p,'index.html','Back to the homepage '+arrow,'text-link')}</div></section>`;}
